        <mxCell id="p4-title-block" value="&amp;lt;b style=&amp;quot;font-size:14px; color:#0F172A;&amp;quot;&amp;gt;STAR Travels — Sơ Đồ Tuần Tự: Tiếp Thị Liên Kết Đối Tác (Affiliate Referral)&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;font color=&amp;quot;#475569&amp;quot; style=&amp;quot;font-size:11px;&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Chuẩn: OMG UML 2.5.1 Sequence Diagram | Cơ chế: Non-blocking beacon tracking&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;i&amp;gt;Phạm vi:&amp;lt;/i&amp;gt; Modal cảnh báo 1.5s, navigator.sendBeacon, Outbox event và đồng bộ Odoo CRM Lead&amp;lt;/font&amp;gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;spacingLeft=14;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
